  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for exploratory geothermal drilling in Grenada</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To drill at least 2 exploration wells and complete associated civil works in Grenada which will provide data to test the conceptual models of the geothermal system and verify the existence, temperature, permeability and extent of the resource. This will help the government make an evidence-based determination on whether to move to the next stage of geothermal resource development for electricity generation and help de-risk for private sector investment.</narrative>
  </description>
